    "title": "Easy Rout Map: Navigation Path",
    "description": "GPS Live Street View app navigates your world faster and easier with voice navigation, transit, cycle, walk, and hike. You real-time traffic, directions, and find your desired places.\r\nNow you can show the world new places, nearby places, real-time traffic conditions, and live location with address, Weather info, street view, Compass, Route Finder, Area calculator, emergency contact, and loads more. Route Map-Driving Direction is designed for all android users with supported 100+ languages that make it easy to use and understand.\r\nCurrent Location & Nearby Places\r\nNo matter what part of the world where you are, With GPS navigation you easily know where to eat, drink and go. You can find your current location details using \u201cWhere am I\u201d application.\r\nLive Street View GPS Real-time\r\nRoute Map-Driving Direction App is a 360 live earth map for your routes and travel destinations. You can find an accurate location with a live street view & earth map and quickly find the nearest public places. You can explore places from around the world. Explore places from around the world with Street View navigation.\r\nRoute Finder and Earth Map Satellite\r\nGPS route finder quickly gets your position on the map and gets your desired directions. Easy Rout Map-Navigation Path App is very helpful for tourists and trips with GPS map road to find accurate & shortest way.\r\nArea Calculator & Digital Compass\r\nStreet view route finder helps you to find distance and traveling time and towards your desired location. Qibla compass will enable you to determine the Kaaba direction from any place in the world.\r\nLive Weather Details\r\nWeather forecasts & storm radar provide the world\u2019s most accurate forecast and weather details like local rain trackers, weather maps & alerts.\r\nCountry Info & World Clock\r\nWorld clock timer shows the current time on the basis of your current location. Route Map & Driving Direction App provides basic detail of almost all countries like population, capital, language, area, currency, borders, and call code.\r\nLeve Meter\r\nLever meter indicates whether a surface is horizontal (level) or vertical (plumb). Easy Rout Map-Navigation Path App is very helpful to check the level of any surface.\r\nSupport Languages & Colorful Themes\r\nEasy Rout Map-Navigation Path App supported almost all languages which makes it easy to use in your desired language. You can change multiple themes that provide a more attractive interface.\r\nBookmark & Area History\r\nYou can add your favorite places to a bookmark that is helpful to reach your target destination. All your activities will be saved in history and you can view and share it easily.\r\nAdvantages\r\nMain merits of a Route Map-Driving Direction for the user.\r\n\u2022\tIt is distributed at no cost.\r\n\u2022\tThe ability to share the result.\r\n\u2022\tIt is lightweight and installed in a matter of seconds.\r\n\u2022\tIt occupies minimum space in your smartphone's memory and consumes very little traffic.",
